{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24185","headline":"翫半开花赠皇甫郎中 · 白居易","name":"翫半开花赠皇甫郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勿讶春来晚，无嫌花发迟。\n人怜全盛日，我爱半开时。\n紫蜡黏爲蔕，红苏点作蕤。\n成都新夹缬，梁汉碎臙脂。\n树杪真珠颗，墙头小女儿。\n浅深妆駮落，高下火参差。\n蝶戏争香朵，莺啼选稳枝。\n好教郎作伴，合共酒相随。\n醉翫无胜此，狂嘲更让谁。\n犹残少年兴，不似老人诗。\n西日凭轻照，东风莫杀吹。\n明朝应烂熳，後夜更离披。\n林下遥相忆，尊前闇有期。\n衔杯嚼蘂思，唯我与君知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}